I flow;;                                                                        
A flow                                                                          
S When did you last lose track of time completely - and what were you doing?    
I joyinventory;;                                                                
A joyinventory                                                                  
S Most people don't actually run out of time for the things they love. They just
S+ quietly decide something else matters more. Not the same thing.              
S What did you used to enjoy that you've quietly stopped doing? Was it really   
S+ 'no time,' or something else?                                                
I badonpurpose;;                                                                
A badonpurpose                                                                  
S Make something bad on purpose today. See how that feels, compared to needing  
S+ it to be good.                                                               
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S Heyyy, you're back!                                                           
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
