I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go play badly at something. On purpose!                                       
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S MC Joy! I got drained of color once, forced into constant competition - so now
S+ I love anything with no winner, no score, no point beyond itself.            
S Not anti-achievement. Just very against the idea that everything needs a      
S+ score.                                                                       
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If work's eating the time you'd spend on this stuff, that's Opux's territory. 
S+ If it's about actual rest, go find Elena.                                    
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Idea floats up where the pixies are, built entirely like one enormous board   
S+ game.                                                                        
S There used to be no rules worth mentioning here. Someone added rules. I'm     
S+ still getting used to having them back optional.                             
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S A man calling himself Master Stakes showed up and turned every game on Idea   
S+ into a bet - stakes, rankings, rules that changed whenever it suited him. I  
S+ played without a break for months, losing more of my color every round.      
S What got me out wasn't winning. It was someone sitting down next to me and    
S+ asking to play the old version - the one I invented myself, back when I was  
S+ small, with no winner at all.                                                
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is way bigger than just Idea! Eight islands, one realm: Gra for love,
S+ Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford for family,
S+ Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are underneath 
S+ it all - plus the hub that connects them.                                    
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_54_recreation_1_practice                                            
A tasks                                                                         
S Block out one real slot of time for something with no score and no point      
S+ beyond itself. Protect it like you would a meeting.                          
S There's a practice about protecting one flow slot in your week. Guard it -    
S+ most people let it get eaten first.                                          
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene invented play before anyone put stakes on it. I'd love to ask her what 
S+ the original rules were.                                                     
S She's the goddess of Eternias! Even Idea has rules it won't bend, and she's   
S+ one of them.                                                                 
